{"step_index":66,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T15:51:56Z","content":"Đang cài Node.js LTS qua winget, chờ hoàn tất... Trong lúc đó tôi sẽ chuẩn bị sẵn toàn bộ cấu trúc project và code để sau khi cài xong là chạy ngay.","tool_calls":[{"name":"invoke_subagents","args":{"Subagents":"[{\"TypeName\": \"self\", \"Role\": \"Next.js Project Scaffolder\", \"Prompt\": \"Tạo đầy đủ toàn bộ source code cho dự án web Khung Kiến trúc Số (KTS) tỉnh Vĩnh Long theo thiết kế sau:\\n\\n## Tech Stack\\n- Next.js 14 (App Router)\\n- TypeScript\\n- Tailwind CSS\\n- Ant Design (antd v5)\\n- Prisma ORM + SQLite (cho dev, dễ chuyển sang PostgreSQL)\\n- NextAuth.js v5 (Auth.js) với credentials provider\\n- React Flow (sơ đồ kiến trúc)\\n- Recharts (biểu đồ dashboard)\\n- shadcn/ui components bổ sung\\n\\n## Thư mục đích: `C:\\\\Delta Force\\\\kts-vinhlong`\\n\\n## Cấu trúc thư mục cần tạo:\\n```\\nkts-vinhlong/\\n├── prisma/\\n│   └── schema.prisma\\n├── src/\\n│   ├── app/\\n│   │   ├── layout.tsx\\n│   │   ├── page.tsx (trang chủ)\\n│   │   ├── globals.css\\n│   │   ├── (portal)/\\n│   │   │   ├── kts/\\n│   │   │   │   ├── tong-quan/page.tsx\\n│   │   │   │   ├── hien-trang/page.tsx\\n│   │   │   │   ├── muc-tieu/page.tsx\\n│   │   │   │   └── lo-trinh/page.tsx\\n│   │   │   └── layout.tsx\\n│   │   ├── dashboard/\\n│   │   │   └── page.tsx\\n│   │   ├── admin/\\n│   │   │   ├── layout.tsx\\n│   │   │   ├── page.tsx\\n│   │   │   ├── khung/page.tsx\\n│   │   │   ├── he-thong/page.tsx\\n│   │   │   ├── nhiem-vu/page.tsx\\n│   │   │   └── import/page.tsx\\n│   │   └── api/\\n│   │       ├── auth/[...nextauth]/route.ts\\n│   │       ├── kts/route.ts\\n│   │       ├── nhiem-vu/route.ts\\n│   │       └── dashboard/stats/route.ts\\n│   ├── components/\\n│   │   ├── layout/\\n│   │   │   ├── Navbar.tsx\\n│   │   │   ├── Sidebar.tsx\\n│   │   │   └── Footer.tsx\\n│   │   ├── kts/\\n│   │   │   ├── KienTrucDiagram.tsx (React Flow sơ đồ 4 lớp)\\n│   │   │   ├── HienTrangCard.tsx\\n│   │   │   └── LoTrinhTimeline.tsx\\n│   │   ├── dashboard/\\n│   │   │   ├── TienDoChart.tsx\\n│   │   │   ├── NhiemVuTable.tsx\\n│   │   │   └── StatsCards.tsx\\n│   │   └── admin/\\n│   │       ├── NhiemVuForm.tsx\\n│   │       └── ImportXlsx.tsx\\n│   ├── lib/\\n│   │   ├── prisma.ts\\n│   │   ├── auth.ts\\n│   │   └── utils.ts\\n│   └── types/\\n│       └── index.ts\\n├── public/\\n├── package.json\\n├── next.config.ts\\n├── tailwind.config.ts\\n├── tsconfig.json\\n└── .env.example\\n```\\n\\n## Database Schema (Prisma) — tạo file prisma/schema.prisma:\\n\\n```prisma\\ngenerator client {\\n  provider = \\\"prisma-client-js\\\"\\n}\\n\\ndatasource db {\\n  provider = \\\"sqlite\\\"\\n  url      = env(\\\"DATABASE_URL\\\")\\n}\\n\\nmodel User {\\n  id        String   @id @default(cuid())\\n  email     String   @unique\\n  password  String\\n  name      String\\n  role      String   @default(\\\"viewer\\\") // admin | editor | viewer\\n  donViId   String?\\n  donVi     DonVi?   @relation(fields: [donViId], references: [id])\\n  createdAt DateTime @default(now())\\n}\\n\\nmodel DonVi {\\n  id        String   @id @default(cuid())\\n  ten       String\\n  loai      String   // tinh | so | huyen | xa\\n  parentId  String?\\n  parent    DonVi?   @relation(\\\"DonViParent\\\", fields: [parentId], references: [id])\\n  children  DonVi[]  @relation(\\\"DonViParent\\\")\\n  users     User[]\\n  heSoList  HeThongSo[]\\n  nhiemVus  NhiemVu[]\\n  createdAt DateTime @default(now())\\n}\\n\\nmodel KhungKTS {\\n  id              String   @id @default(cuid())\\n  tenKhung        String\\n  phienBan        String\\n  ngayBanHanh     DateTime?\\n  giaiDoanApDung  String?\\n  mucTieu         String?\\n  boiCanh         String?\\n  nguyenTac       String?\\n  daiDienPhuTrach String?\\n  trangThai       String   @default(\\\"draft\\\") // draft | published\\n  updatedAt       DateTime @updatedAt\\n  createdAt       DateTime @default(now())\\n}\\n\\nmodel HeThongSo {\\n  id          String   @id @default(cuid())\\n  ma          String\\n  ten         String\\n  loai        String   // ha-tang | du-lieu | ung-dung | kenh-tuong-tac\\n  lop         Int      // 1 | 2 | 3 | 4\\n  moTa        String?\\n  chuQuan     String?\\n  trangThai   String   @default(\\\"dang-van-hanh\\\") // dang-van-hanh | can-nang-cap | can-thay-the | ke-hoach\\n  namTrienKhai Int?\\n  donViId     String?\\n  donVi       DonVi?   @relation(fields: [donViId], references: [id])\\n  anhXas      AnhXa[]\\n  ketNois     KetNoi[] @relation(\\\"KetNoiNguon\\\")\\n  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())\\n  updatedAt   DateTime @updatedAt\\n}\\n\\nmodel KetNoi {\\n  id          String     @id @default(cuid())\\n  nguonId     String\\n  nguon       HeThongSo  @relation(\\\"KetNoiNguon\\\", fields: [nguonId], references: [id])\\n  dichId      String\\n  loaiKetNoi  String     // chia-se | tich-hop | ket-noi-api | dong-bo\\n  moTa        String?\\n  createdAt   DateTime   @default(now())\\n}\\n\\nmodel AnhXa {\\n  id           String    @id @default(cuid())\\n  heThongSoId  String\\n  heThongSo    HeThongSo @relation(fields: [heThongSoId], references: [id])\\n  mucTieu      String    // ten thanh phan muc tieu\\n  phuongAnXuLy String    // tiep-tuc | chuan-hoa | nang-cap | hop-nhat | thay-the | bo-sung\\n  moTa         String?\\n  createdAt    DateTime  @default(now())\\n}\\n\\nmodel NhiemVu {\\n  id            String    @id @default(cuid())\\n  ma            String\\n  ten           String\\n  moTa          String?\\n  donViChuTriId String?\\n  donViChuTri   DonVi?    @relation(fields: [donViChuTriId], references: [id])\\n  uuTien        String    @default(\\\"trung-binh\\\") // cao | trung-binh | thap\\n  thoiHan       DateTime?\\n  giaiDoan      String?\\n  kpi           String?\\n  nguonKiemChung String?\\n  trangThai     String    @default(\\\"chua-bat-dau\\\") // chua-bat-dau | dang-thuc-hien | hoan-thanh | tre-han\\n  tienDo        Int       @default(0) // 0-100%\\n  lop           Int       // 1 | 2 | 3 | 4\\n  phuongAnXuLy  String?\\n  ghiChu        String?\\n  createdAt     DateTime  @default(now())\\n  updatedAt     DateTime  @updatedAt\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## Yêu cầu code chi tiết:\\n\\n### 1. package.json\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"kts-vinhlong\\\",\\n  \\\"version\\\": \\\"0.1.0\\\",\\n  \\\"private\\\": true,\\n  \\\"scripts\\\": {\\n    \\\"dev\\\": \\\"next dev\\\",\\n    \\\"build\\\": \\\"next build\\\",\\n    \\\"start\\\": \\\"next start\\\",\\n    \\\"db:push\\\": \\\"prisma db push\\\",\\n    \\\"db:seed\\\": \\\"ts-node prisma/seed.ts\\\",\\n    \\\"db:studio\\\": \\\"prisma studio\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"dependencies\\\": {\\n    \\\"next\\\": \\\"14.2.5\\\",\\n    \\\"react\\\": \\\"^18\\\",\\n    \\\"react-dom\\\": \\\"^18\\\",\\n    \\\"typescript\\\": \\\"^5\\\",\\n    \\\"@prisma/client\\\": \\\"^5.16.0\\\",\\n    \\\"prisma\\\": \\\"^5.16.0\\\",\\n    \\\"next-auth\\\": \\\"^5.0.0-beta.20\\\",\\n    \\\"@auth/prisma-adapter\\\": \\\"^2.4.1\\\",\\n    \\\"antd\\\": \\\"^5.19.0\\\",\\n    \\\"@ant-design/icons\\\": \\\"^5.3.7\\\",\\n    \\\"@ant-design/charts\\\": \\\"^2.2.0\\\",\\n    \\\"reactflow\\\": \\\"^11.11.4\\\",\\n    \\\"recharts\\\": \\\"^2.12.7\\\",\\n    \\\"bcryptjs\\\": \\\"^2.4.3\\\",\\n    \\\"@types/bcryptjs\\\": \\\"^2.4.6\\\",\\n    \\\"xlsx\\\": \\\"^0.18.5\\\",\\n    \\\"dayjs\\\": \\\"^1.11.11\\\",\\n    \\\"clsx\\\": \\\"^2.1.1\\\",\\n    \\\"tailwind-merge\\\": \\\"^2.4.0\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"devDependencies\\\": {\\n    \\\"@types/node\\\": \\\"^20\\\",\\n    \\\"@types/react\\\": \\\"^18\\\",\\n    \\\"@types/react-dom\\\": \\\"^18\\\",\\n    \\\"autoprefixer\\\": \\\"^10.0.1\\\",\\n    \\\"postcss\\\": \\\"^8\\\",\\n    \\\"tailwindcss\\\": \\\"^3.4.1\\\",\\n    \\\"ts-node\\\": \\\"^10.9.2\\\"\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### 2. Tạo đầy đủ tất cả các file sau với nội dung đầy đủ, không placeholder:\\n\\nTạo các file trong `C:\\\\Delta Force\\\\kts-vinhlong\\\\` với nội dung thực tế đầy đủ:\\n\\n**File: .env.example**\\n```\\nDATABASE_URL=\\\"file:./dev.db\\\"\\nNEXTAUTH_SECRET=\\\"your-secret-key-change-this\\\"\\nNEXTAUTH_URL=\\\"http://localhost:3000\\\"\\n```\\n\\n**File: .env** (copy từ example, dùng thực)\\n```\\nDATABASE_URL=\\\"file:./dev.db\\\"\\nNEXTAUTH_SECRET=\\\"kts-vinhlong-secret-2026\\\"\\nNEXTAUTH_URL=\\\"http://localhost:3000\\\"\\n```\\n\\nViết đầy đủ nội dung cho TẤT CẢ file sau (không được để TODO hay placeholder):\\n\\n1. `next.config.ts` — config Next.js với antd transpile\\n2. `tailwind.config.ts` — tailwind với antd compat\\n3. `tsconfig.json` — typescript config\\n4. `src/lib/prisma.ts` — singleton prisma client\\n5. `src/lib/auth.ts` — NextAuth config với credentials provider, bcrypt, roles\\n6. `src/lib/utils.ts` — helper functions (cn, formatDate, getTrangThaiColor, getLopLabel, getPhuongAnLabel)\\n7. `src/types/index.ts` — TypeScript interfaces\\n8. `src/app/globals.css` — tailwind directives + antd compat\\n9. `src/app/layout.tsx` — root layout với AntdRegistry\\n10. `src/app/page.tsx` — trang chủ đẹp: hero section với ảnh nền gradient xanh nhà nước, thống kê tổng quan (số hệ thống, nhiệm vụ, % hoàn thành), 4 card lớp kiến trúc, nút điều hướng\\n11. `src/app/(portal)/layout.tsx` — layout portal với Navbar\\n12. `src/app/(portal)/kts/tong-quan/page.tsx` — trang tổng quan KTS: mục tiêu, bối cảnh, nguyên tắc kiến trúc, thông tin đầu mối\\n13. `src/app/(portal)/kts/hien-trang/page.tsx` — trang hiện trạng: 4 tab theo 4 lớp, mỗi lớp có danh sách hệ thống với badge trạng thái\\n14. `src/app/(portal)/kts/muc-tieu/page.tsx` — trang sơ đồ kiến trúc mục tiêu dùng React Flow với 4 lớp node được nhóm theo màu\\n15. `src/app/(portal)/kts/lo-trinh/page.tsx` — bảng nhiệm vụ với filter theo lớp/trạng thái, progress bar, timeline\\n16. `src/app/dashboard/page.tsx` — dashboard lãnh đạo: 4 stat cards, donut chart tiến độ, bar chart theo l